**File:** `/workspace/repo/packages/core/src/telemetry/clearcut-logger/event-metadata-key.ts`

Enum declaration opens at **line 8** (`export enum EventMetadataKey {`) and closes at **line 725**. The last members (lines 685–725 region) are the Gemini Enterprise onboarding keys:

```ts
718    // Logs the start of the onboarding process.
